<h2>About MyQuote</h2>
<p class="lead">
  MyQuote is a web application that allows users to collect and share their favourite
  philosophical quotes and search through those collected by other users.
</p>

<h4>Features</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Standard users can sign up, sign in, manage personal details, and change password.</li>
  <li>Standard users can add, edit, comment on, and delete their own quotes.</li>
  <li>Quotes can be public or private.</li>
  <li>Administrators can manage users, categories and philosophers.</li>
  <li>Anyone can browse public quotes and search by category or keyword.</li>
</ul>